+## 2. Exact proposition
+
+For a finite vertex type `V` and graph `G`, assume positive minimum degree and
+even maximum degree.  Writing `D = G.maxDegree`, `i =
+G.indepDominationNumber`, and `n = Fintype.card V`, the target is
